    "text_rich_text_dyxq7m": {
      "type": "text--rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_h3JRtE": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The innovative CleanUP Powder formula"
          }
        },
        "richtext_yd9b6z": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>— unique globally — contains <strong>14 pure amino acids</strong> chosen to support both <strong>structure and function of the stratum corneum</strong>. The complex mimics the <strong>physiological amino acid profile of NMF (Natural Moisturizing Factor)</strong> and the <strong>modulatory action of placental peptides</strong>, feeding cells and building tolerance even in sensitized skin.</p>",
            "text_size": 16
          }
        },
        "heading_8wA9dX": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Key functions:"
          }
        },
        "richtext_7F8b8c": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li><strong>regeneration</strong>: proline, glycine, serine, glutamic acid assist in synthesis of epidermal proteins (filaggrin, involucrin);</li><li><strong>hydration</strong>: amino acids act as osmolytes, binding moisture and maintaining electrolyte stability;</li><li><strong>immunomodulation</strong>: arginine, taurine, histidine exhibit antioxidant and anti-inflammatory properties, reducing pro-inflammatory cytokine production;</li><li><strong>textural correction</strong>: leucine, isoleucine, phenylalanine remodel microrelief, enhancing smoothness and density</li></ul><p><strong>The amino acid system in </strong><a href=\"https://resenss.com/collections/all/products/cleanup-powder?_pos=6&_fid=c4324c8a7&_ss=c\"><strong>CleanUP Powder</strong></a><strong> not only compensates for NMF losses but also actively engages in recovery processes — reducing sensitivity, flaking, and microinflammation.</strong>.</p>",
            "text_size": 14
          }
        }
      },
